# Tribunal "The Summoner": Drathas Reyas in the Great Bazaar tells of a wizard
# (latest rumors, which starts VelasCellCheck); the next cell change sets his
# `change`, and Ovis Velas then appears within 750 units of the player,
# force-greets and attacks (OvisScript). His death logs 1; Drathas names the
# Velas Manor in Godsreach (10). There Gavis Velas force-greets within 250
# units; "my unfortunate brother" logs 20 and he summons two golden saints and
# an ogrim titan (GavisScript). His death logs 30.
# Kills stand in for the fights; `defend` takes the summons. Ref FormIDs carry
# Tribunal.esm's slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_ms_museum --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case ms_summoner
run
player->PositionCell 1738 920 103 0 "Mournhold, Great Bazaar"
until 600 "drathas reyas"->GetDistance player < 400
talk drathas reyas
ask latest rumors
expect ScriptRunning VelasCellCheck == 1
bye
run
player->PositionCell 1 220 -110 0 "Mournhold, Museum of Artifacts"
until 300 GetPCCell "Mournhold, Museum of Artifacts" == 1
until 300 "drathas reyas".change == 1
run
player->PositionCell 901 850 34 0 "Mournhold, Great Bazaar"
until 300 GetPCCell "Mournhold, Great Bazaar" == 1
until 900 "ovis velas"->GetDisabled == 0
defend
until 600 MenuMode == 1
bye
console 0670787D.kill
until 600 GetJournalIndex MS_Summoner == 1
run
player->PositionCell 1738 920 103 0 "Mournhold, Great Bazaar"
until 600 "drathas reyas"->GetDistance player < 400
talk drathas reyas
expect GetJournalIndex MS_Summoner == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell 6 300 -128 0 "Mournhold, Velas Manor"
until 300 GetPCCell "Mournhold, Velas Manor" == 1
until 600 "gavis velas"->GetDisabled == 0
until 600 MenuMode == 1
ask my unfortunate brother
expect GetJournalIndex MS_Summoner == 20
bye
console 0679077A.kill
until 600 GetJournalIndex MS_Summoner == 30
end
